# Media
# Full-resolution originals live in media-originals/ and never ship (several
# exceed GitHub's 100 MB file limit). public/ holds the web-optimized copies the
# site actually serves, so it is tracked: Vercel builds from the repo and only
# sees what is committed.
media-originals/
scripts/media/.cache.json
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.mp4
*.mov
*.jpeg
!/public/**
